"css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c4dfc43", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "05", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6b04fce", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nenajde vás Google", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b95da52", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Na důležité fráze se web neukazuje.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "3c80eb3", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "dfca06d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "06", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "97c8355", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Zastaralý vzhled", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9350dfb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web působí jako z jiné doby a podkopává důvěru.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "78dc9a1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "489fb84", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "07", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c288124", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chybí GDPR a cookies", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c69e0f0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Starý web nesplňuje dnešní požadavky na souhlas s cookies.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "cdac69f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "54462eb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "08", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "29324dc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chcete víc", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "609a0b9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Rezervace, jazyky nebo e-shop, které starý web neumí.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "dab784a", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "detail"}, "elements": [{"id": "aaf0f65", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-legal-wrap ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "f6184df", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Jak probíhá redesign webu", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b4ea98b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Začínáme auditem: projdeme obsah, strukturu, návštěvnost a to, na co se web ve vyhledávání ukazuje. Poté navrhneme novou strukturu, připravíme texty a design. Nový web spustíme tak, aby staré adresy vedly na nové stránky.</p><h3>Redesign webu bez ztráty pozic</h3><p>Největší riziko redesignu je ztráta návštěvnosti z Googlu. Proto mapujeme staré adresy, nastavujeme přesměrování a po spuštění kontrolujeme Search Console.</p><h3>Redesign, nebo úplně nový web?</h3><p>Pokud je současný web na WordPressu a obsah je v pořádku, často stačí nový design a úprava struktury. Pokud ne, postavíme <a href=\"/tvorba-webu-na-miru/\">nový web na míru</a> a obsah převedeme.</p><h3>Kolik stojí redesign webu</h3><p>Cena závisí na rozsahu webu a množství obsahu k převodu. Orientační přehled najdete na stránce <a href=\"/kolik-stoji-web/\">Kolik stojí web</a>, přesnou nabídku připravíme zdarma.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-legaltext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "c31972c", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "6e65ed1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8f6d634", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a3c9a7e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "97ba1d2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1b63d41", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "158d4e4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9075b32", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6ef2da8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "54de206", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "de151eb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "10636aa", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "716c683", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "64394a9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fe4bce8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "653779c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b1aafd2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "6cc3d34", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2a926e1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4904d7d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "30b8945", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "92cdd17", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3b14056", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "caf193a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b56026a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci